# DS5006: a card takes only `title`.
mode: check
schema: t(customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long)
---- query
from t
| render card with (ycolumns = revenue)
---- expected
error[DS5006]: `ycolumns` does not apply to a `card`
  --> query:2:21
  |
2 | | render card with (ycolumns = revenue)
  |                     ^^^^^^^^ not a `card` property
  |
  = note: a `card` accepts only `title`
